# Filter button (กฎเหล็ก)

Canonical = ปุ่มตัวกรองใน `ScheduleEditor` (portal header).

## Must use

| Piece | Value |
|-------|--------|
| Style | `HEADER_ICON_BTN` from `@/lib/headerIconBtn` |
| Icon | `HiOutlineFunnel` from `react-icons/hi2` |
| Icon size | `size={16}` (or `className="h-4 w-4"`) |
| Group | `HEADER_ICON_BTN_GROUP` when beside other header icons |
| Active badge | optional `absolute` dot `bg-destructive` — do not restyle the button |

```tsx
import { HiOutlineFunnel } from 'react-icons/hi2'
import { HEADER_ICON_BTN, HEADER_ICON_BTN_GROUP } from '@/lib/headerIconBtn'
import { cn } from '@/lib/utils'

<button
  type="button"
  onClick={openFilter}
  className={HEADER_ICON_BTN}
  title="ตัวกรอง"
  aria-label="ตัวกรอง"
>
  <HiOutlineFunnel size={16} />
  {hasActiveFilters && (
    <span className="absolute top-1 right-1 h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-destructive" aria-hidden />
  )}
</button>
```

Prefer shared trigger when available: `ExamMobileFilterTriggerButton` in `@/features/exam/components/ExamMobileFilterMenuButton` (must stay on `HEADER_ICON_BTN` + `HiOutlineFunnel`).

## Forbidden

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — hand-rolled look / wrong icon
<button className="rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white ...">
  <Filter />  {/* lucide / HiFunnel / HiMiniFunnel */}
</button>

// ❌ BAD — text chip instead of header icon for portal filter trigger
<Button variant="outline">ตัวกรอง</Button>
```

## Scope

Applies to **filter triggers** that open a filter drawer/sheet/popover (header portals, mobile actions, list toolbars).

Does **not** apply to: “ล้างตัวกรอง” text actions, filter chips inside a drawer, or form selects.
